Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1014-1015] Onigashima 29 - A Lifelong Ham Actor.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You managed to cover yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.21,0:00:12.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...in Conqueror's Haki...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the way you handled it...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...was crude and clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.20,0:00:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:47.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still trying to win against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:49.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm enjoying this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.51,0:00:55.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was it, now...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.15,0:01:16.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You couldn't be Joyboy either...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.45,0:01:19.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.17,0:02:55.75,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.17,0:02:55.75,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.43,0:03:06.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raccoon dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:08.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:20.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He grabbed his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.90,0:03:59.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopperemon-san is\Noverpowering Queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:17.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure sound ragged\Nfor someone who's supposed to be winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.50,0:04:19.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, Raccoon Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:27.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wonder how much more he can take.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.77,0:04:32.77,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(331,795)}Castle interior\NThird floor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.56,0:04:36.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We shall no longer\Ntake flight nor hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.98,0:04:42.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you are, Young Master Yamato!\NCome back to us, nice and easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:45.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:47.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:54.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The young master's not handcuffed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed!\NI am no longer a captive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:00.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:03.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:08.34,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1675,905)}First floor\NCrawl space
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:10.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:10.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I believe...\NI cannot and must not perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:18.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That goes without saying!\NWhy do you say this now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.15,0:05:23.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:28.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?! What is it this time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:32.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring...\NRing, ring, ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:33.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clik.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.87,0:05:37.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-sama!\NWe found Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:39.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:40.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayyyye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:44.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let all of Onigashima know,\NBao Huang...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.01,0:05:48.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My battle with Straw Hat is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.51,0:05:53.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what they do now,\Nit's all pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.23,0:06:05.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More incoming!\NIt's another candy arrow volley!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:07.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:15.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopperemon-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:20.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Rumble Ball's effects wear off\Nin less than ten minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:24.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lot of good\Nthat extra time did me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.39,0:06:35.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are laughable results!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:39.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three minutes of gigantification?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:41.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it you think\Nyou can do in that time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.73,0:06:47.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But there's a side effect of remaining in\Nmonster form for more than three minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.07,0:06:47.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.44,0:06:48.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:51.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You only care about yourself, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.37,0:06:54.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.53,0:06:55.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:02.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dictate the chemicals,\Nand you fetch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:06.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We will be extending the duration of\Ngigantification to thirty minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.55,0:07:08.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ten times the length!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:11.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There will be risks, oh yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:13.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...but you're not afraid, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:16.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:19.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.07,0:07:32.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black Light Roast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:41.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scurrying around...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.71,0:07:48.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaddap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.13,0:07:49.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaddap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:50.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaddap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:50.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaddap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:53.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya cocky little raccoon dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.14,0:08:01.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marys:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.19,0:08:04.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spread-the-News Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:14.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To all those here at Onigashima,\Nmay I have your attention, pleeeease!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:19.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The duel iiiis... over!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:24.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The highest bounty among the enemy forces,\NStraw Hat Luffy, waaaas...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:28.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...de-fea-teeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:29.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:32.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopperemon-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.89,0:08:39.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:41.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's over, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:46.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-sama choked the life\Nout of hiim...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:48.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:09:04.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and sent Straw Hat Luffy to the deepest,\Ndarkest depths of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:06.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:14.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:18.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less\Nabout that dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.01,0:09:23.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Both the Kozuki samuraaaai...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:25.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...have fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:28.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's next? Can anyone win?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.27,0:09:32.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even Kin'emon's party?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:40.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-sama's heading downstairs\Nto start "cleeeeaning" house!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.78,0:09:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't believe she wrecked the castle...\NDammit, Linlin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:51.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-sama will...\Ngladly accept your surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:10:03.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any that raise their hands in surrender...\Nand submit to uuuus...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:06.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatta load of bull!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.89,0:10:11.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!\NWhat is wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:41.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.39,0:10:45.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I must tell everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.89,0:10:49.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surrender,\Nsub-jects of Wa-no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:51.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The war is loooost!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.60,0:10:54.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The contest has endeeeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:58.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy was...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.11,0:11:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...sent to the deepest,\Ndarkest depths of the seeeea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:10.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...our situation is dire,\Nis it not, Kin-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have had it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.48,0:11:32.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How long it has been!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:34.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What...\NIt cannot be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:37.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You look to be well too, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:41.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,F-Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:45.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mustn't, Shinobu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.41,0:11:48.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father! Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.29,0:11:49.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do not set eyes upon him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:52.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:55.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this?\NLet him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:58.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the tearful reunion\Nof father and son!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.09,0:12:00.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:02.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stand back, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.09,0:12:06.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am Kozuki Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.47,0:12:13.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once before, and now again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:17.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come now, Kiku, what is the matter?!\NNo need for the grim face!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.77,0:12:19.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Tis I!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.78,0:12:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.95,0:12:23.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.41,0:12:26.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...do what you did to Ashura-san...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.67,0:12:42.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do not approach, Kiku!\NWhat is it you intend?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.51,0:12:44.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.51,0:12:51.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ho, now, Kiku!\NSurely you jest!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I took you and Izo under my wing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:03.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.03,0:13:05.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:13.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you have the will\Nto cut me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.31,0:13:37.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't the will...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.02,0:13:39.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin-sama...\NI cannot...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:41.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:53.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.91,0:13:56.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.80,0:14:09.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the wound\Nyou inflicted upon me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.76,0:14:16.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I, too, am at\Ndeath's door, Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:20.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My shame is unbearable...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.15,0:14:29.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kikunojo of the Fallen Snow...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.91,0:14:31.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,can go no further...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.37,0:14:33.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.29,0:14:37.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the fallen snow melts...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.37,0:14:42.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...surely this country's Dawn\Nis soon to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.84,0:14:47.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Foolishness!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:51.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It shall come!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:55.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the light from Wano's Dawn\Nshall stretch into the afterlife!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.31,0:15:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.27,0:15:03.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kikunojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.65,0:15:09.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Were this a stage production,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:13.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it would certainly have been hailed as\Nthis century's greatest work!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:18.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you are the next\Nactor in line, Kin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.46,0:15:27.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall set the stage\Nfor your final moments!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.89,0:15:42.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A most unfortunate man...\NHis lord, slain. A friend, now turned foe...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.27,0:15:44.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What awaits him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.32,0:15:48.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tragedy, perhaps?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:50.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or comedy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.74,0:15:56.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Play your role, Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.66,0:15:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Decorate this stage\Nwith your honorable death!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:04.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.75,0:16:05.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.75,0:16:05.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.09,0:16:06.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.28,0:16:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.78,0:16:36.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.03,0:16:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna take in a pervert like him,\NOden-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.87,0:16:45.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just let me off!\NHow many times do I need to say sorry?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.26,0:17:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed!\NRaizo moves with the same rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.68,0:17:02.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess who!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.02,0:17:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C-Could it be you, Kanjuro?\NI know you are the only person there...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:08.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look out! Duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.11,0:17:15.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop this ridiculous\N"ninja art" nonse—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.25,0:17:29.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there is anyone that ought\Ndrop the curtain upon my play,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.17,0:17:31.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it should be you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.68,0:17:39.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because upon this stage...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:45.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were...\Nthe best of... friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:12.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku! Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.23,0:18:37.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.24,0:18:44.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you were hiding here, runt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:48.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!\NTake Momonosuke-sama and flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.33,0:18:51.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.30,0:18:59.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Out of my way, Wano Samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will not move for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:10.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then kiss your ass goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.96,0:19:41.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emoooon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.82,0:20:03.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:09.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...\NDid you really lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.13,0:20:22.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then...\NWhat do we...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.14,0:20:29.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.19,0:20:38.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat lost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.19,0:20:41.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no point in\Nfighting anymore?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:44.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bao Huang's announcement...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.03,0:20:49.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...caused great distress among the samurai\Nunited by their desire to subdue Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:55.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The straw hat man?!\NImpossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What of Momonosuke-sama's state?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.21,0:21:01.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy wouldn't go down that easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:04.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hear that?!\NDon't underestimate our captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:10.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And so, the airborne Onigashima...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:24.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...finally reaches the skies\Nover the mainland of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:28.28,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(446,479)}Onigashima\Nreaches the skies\Nover the mainland\Nof Wano
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:37.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After chowing down on that dumpling from Speed,\NI feel freakin' amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:39.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno the particulars,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:44.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but the bunch of ya managed to rope in\Nthe strongest rookies imaginable!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.80,0:21:47.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They ain't weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:49.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just that Kaido-sama's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.01,0:21:53.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.06,0:22:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Slicing Rounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.95,0:22:09.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kappa Style:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.79,0:22:14.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,River of Retribution!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:19.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if Straw Hat is dead,\Nwe do not give up the fight 'til Kaido is defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:21.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:23.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have yet to confirm\Nwhether Straw Hat is alive or dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.46,0:22:28.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But even hinting at his death\Nis enough to crush morale...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.26,0:22:31.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye.\NWe've no way to uncover the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.31,0:22:36.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swear, every last one of ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.56,0:22:41.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.08,0:23:02.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.75,0:23:04.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No crying...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.46,0:23:08.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just gotta fight,\N'n fight some more...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.76,0:23:10.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raccoon Dog-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.89,0:23:17.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You had spunk,\Nso i felt like messin' with ya a little!?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.23,0:23:24.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your top man goes down,\Nand now all hell's broken loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.82,0:23:27.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now, a present from me\Nto the unruly mob.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.86,0:23:29.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mlem!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.45,0:23:39.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not that attack again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.71,0:23:46.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's it, I can't take it anymore!\NI got nowhere to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.47,0:23:55.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're toast, too,\Nya cowardly freaks
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.35,0:23:58.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bet your meat's real tender!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.14,0:24:00.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bet your meat's real tender!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.06,0:24:06.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Diable Jambe...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.04,0:24:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Rotisserie...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.01,0:24:33.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.99,0:24:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's just no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.83,0:25:03.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey...\NHey, hey, c'moooon!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.08,0:25:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mleeeem!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.27,0:25:24.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.73,0:25:27.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Way to hang in there,\NChopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.77,0:25:34.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lu...\NLuffy's...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.53,0:25:39.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No crying allowed, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.83,0:25:43.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.20,0:25:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many times have we seen...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.71,0:25:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...miracles?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.47,0:26:05.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:08.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.35,0:26:10.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.27,0:26:14.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Sanji! What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.11,0:26:16.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once he recovers,\Nhe'll be as strong as ten men.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.28,0:26:22.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hoeh?!\NZoro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.37,0:26:29.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just leave the dino to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.59,0:26:34.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you the one that did it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.55,0:26:36.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Judge's son!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.76,0:26:42.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's not quitting the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.64,0:26:47.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His captain's dead...\NWhy does he keep fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.40,0:26:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why I like you guys,\Noh yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.63,0:27:19.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.55,0:27:25.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.02,0:27:32.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.69,0:27:34.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are still...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.07,0:27:37.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...battling...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.49,0:27:42.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.29,0:27:52.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.63,0:27:59.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...allow you to...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.84,0:28:01.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...lay even a finger...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.05,0:28:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...upon Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.56,0:28:18.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.48,0:28:21.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.45,0:28:26.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I may humbly suggest...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.95,0:28:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From this day forth,\Nrefer to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.08,0:28:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as your father!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.71,0:28:35.21,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(921,509)}Grave of Kozuki Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.63,0:28:42.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Refer to you, Kin'emon, as "Father?"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.30,0:28:43.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.14,0:28:47.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I do not wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.22,0:28:49.22,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(521,703)}Grave of retainer Kin'emon
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.22,0:28:49.22,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(864,354)}Grave of Kozuki Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.05,0:28:49.18,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(240,860)}Grave of retainer Kanjuro
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.60,0:28:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I do not wish for them to discover\Nthat you are descended from Oden-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.35,0:29:00.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It would come as no surprise\Nwere an attempt were made on your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.28,0:29:02.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I beg your understanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.53,0:29:09.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Very well.\NI am in your hands, Kin'emon...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.00,0:29:15.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our thanks, Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.17,0:29:20.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, refer to me as "Father."\NMomonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.09,0:29:23.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That I shall, Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.42,0:29:29.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Using honorifics, referring to Kin'emon by name...\NNothing at all has changed between you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.68,0:29:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You both certainly have\Na long road ahead of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.44,0:29:40.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, Momonosuke,\NMomonosuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.77,0:29:42.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.11,0:29:45.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, Momonosuke,\NMomonosuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.03,0:29:46.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.11,0:29:49.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke! Momonosuke!\NMomonosuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.24,0:29:50.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.58,0:29:53.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke! Momonosuke!\NMomonosuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.08,0:29:54.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.37,0:29:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, Momonosuke,\NMomonosuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.25,0:29:58.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.37,0:30:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, Momonosuke,\NMomonosuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.21,0:30:02.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.46,0:30:05.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke! Momonosuke!\NMomonosuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.42,0:30:06.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.34,0:30:12.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have been uttering honorifics\Nunder your breath the entire time...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.35,0:30:17.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have not improved a whit!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.06,0:30:21.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mo... Mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.78,0:30:25.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is a true ordeal!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.32,0:30:31.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together, Kin...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.99,0:30:33.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,F-Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.46,0:30:40.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I ought to\Ntrade places with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.34,0:30:43.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.71,0:30:46.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was repugnant,\Nno matter how you look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.43,0:30:58.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.85,0:31:01.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.82,0:31:09.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the point\Nof stalling for time?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.53,0:31:14.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's gonna change\Nby him fleeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.62,0:31:17.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.37,0:31:23.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flee for your life,\NMomonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.96,0:31:27.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.92,0:31:30.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.84,0:31:34.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must live on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.56,0:31:38.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.93,0:31:41.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Face death as a warrior should!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.83,0:32:07.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The problem with defeat is...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.18,0:32:22.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...few can accept it\Nwhen it comes for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.49,0:32:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh? A frog?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.36,0:32:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!\NWhy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.70,0:32:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I must tell them...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.33,0:32:46.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can hear his voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.04,0:32:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.68,0:32:54.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.01,0:32:56.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.68,0:32:58.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.14,0:33:02.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.27,0:33:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.32,0:33:19.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.45,0:33:22.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Kozuki Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.33,0:33:23.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.62,0:33:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!\NYou're all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.63,0:33:36.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall relay to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.80,0:33:38.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Luffy's words!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.22,0:33:40.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.60,0:33:43.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But didn't Kaido\Nkill Luffytaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.61,0:33:53.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy yet lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.36,0:34:02.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He speaks to me now!\NSaying that he shall return!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.00,0:34:05.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.58,0:34:09.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And so you must\Ncontinue the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.58,0:34:12.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though it may be painful\Nand difficult!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.93,0:34:19.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I must ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.34,0:34:24.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as you draw breath, fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.72,0:34:27.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, if Momonosuke-sama's\Nordering it...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.39,0:34:29.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We fight while we still live!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.74,0:34:39.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.45,0:34:41.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.87,0:34:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo!
